#. <CLT 4>この被害者が身にまとっていた白衣も
#. すっかり焼け焦げてるな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The white jacket the victim was wearing got totally\n"
"burnt up.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、一部しか残っていない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's only one little piece left...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の上半身が黒コゲになっている。
#. あの爆発で燃えたせいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The upper half of the body got set on fire in the\n"
"explosion, so it's totally blackened...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>しかも、黒コゲになった<CLT><CLT 3>“上半身だけ”<CLT><CLT 4>が、
#. 濡れているけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Also, the <CLT><CLT 3>top half<CLT><CLT 4> of the body is wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これは、あの時…
#. ボクが水をかけたせいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>That's because it got set on fire, and I threw water\n"
"on it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクは“燃えている上半身”に水をかけたんだ。
#. だから、下半身は濡れてなくて当然だ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Since I only threw water on the part that was on\n"
"fire—the top half—the bottom half is still dry.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり、<CLT 3>“上半身だけ”<CLT><CLT 4>が濡れてるからって、
#. 何もおかしくない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words, there's nothing strange about <CLT 3>the top\n"
"half<CLT><CLT 4> being wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>おかしくない…んだよな？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There...isn't, right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>爆破された死体の特徴<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Exploded Body Analysis<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth\n"
"Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. あれ…？
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr ""

#. 死体の爪の部分に、何か付着しているみたいだ。
#. これって…
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's something weird about the body's\n"
"fingernails..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>つけ爪<CLT>だよな…？　
#. しかも、随分長いつけ爪だな。
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, these are <CLT 3>fake nails<CLT>. They're really long..."
msgstr ""

#. ジャマなくらいに…長いつけ爪だ…
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"They seem like they'd get in the way of normal\n"
"activity."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>つけ爪<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Fake Nails<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the Truth Bullets\n"
"section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、右手の甲の部分にも何か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's also something on the back of her right\n"
"hand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって、<CLT><CLT 3>タトゥー<CLT><CLT 4>か…？
#. 火傷のせいでハッキリとはわからないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this...a <CLT><CLT 3>tattoo<CLT><CLT 4>? It got burned, so I can't make\n"
"out the whole thing, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>犬をモチーフ<CLT><CLT 4>にしたような…
#. あまり見た事のないデザインだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like it's <CLT><CLT 3>a picture of a dog<CLT><CLT 4> or something.\n"
"I've never seen anything like it before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23><CLT><CLT 3>右手の甲のタトゥー<CLT><CLT 23>を手帳に記録しました。
#. 言弾（コトダマ）メニューで確認できます。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0018 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>\"<CLT><CLT 3>Tattoo on the Right Hand<CLT><CLT 23>\" has been added to the\n"
"Truth Bullets section of your handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 死体の爪の部分に…何か付着している。
#. これって…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"There's something weird about the body's\n"
"fingernails..."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 3>つけ爪<CLT>だよな…？　
#. しかも、随分長いつけ爪だ。
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Oh, these are <CLT 3>fake nails<CLT>. They're really long..."
msgstr ""

#. ジャマなくらいに…長いつけ爪…
msgctxt "0021 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"They seem like they'd get in the way of normal\n"
"activity."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>それに、右手の甲の部分にも何か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's also something on the back of her right\n"
"hand...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これって<CLT><CLT 3>タトゥー<CLT><CLT 4>か…？
#. 火傷のせいでハッキリとはわからないけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Is this...a <CLT><CLT 3>tattoo<CLT><CLT 4>? It got burned, so I can't make\n"
"out the whole thing, but...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>犬をモチーフ<CLT><CLT 4>にしたような…
#. 見た事のないデザインだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It looks like it's <CLT><CLT 3>a picture of a dog<CLT><CLT 4> or something.\n"
"I've never seen anything like it before.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>死体の下半身は…濡れてないみたいだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The lower half of the body didn't get wet at all...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この死体が爆発で燃えた際、
#. ボクは燃えていた上半身だけに水を掛けたんだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0026 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>After the body blew up, the top half got set on fire,\n"
"so I dumped a bucket of water on it.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だから、下半身は濡れてない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which explains why the bottom half isn't wet.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何も…間違ってないよな…？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's nothing strange about that...right?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0029 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0030 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>死体から離れますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0031 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Step away from the dead body?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まだ気になる所がある…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't think I've seen everything there is to see...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
